/-!
# Tightly embedded subgroups and 2-group structure

Source: Aschbacher--Smith, *The Classification of Quasithin Groups*, I.7,
printed pp.425--427. The imported development proves Remark I.7.1 and
I.7.2--I.7.5 with the genuine Sylow setup and relative normality conventions.
The Frattini argument proves that distinct conjugate Sylow intersections in
the containing 2-group form an internal direct product, with multiplication
as the isomorphism. No recognition or classification hypothesis is used.
-/
